Harrow, once called Leitmotif, is a [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] of the first generation. It set out to take the life and abilities of other Thessians into itself, and took a new name when it began killing them. It has killed at least one of the good Thessians; [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]] was present when it happened and took part of that one's portfolio rather than let the Harrow swallow it whole, and the Harrow got the knowledge out of the kill.

The Harrow is barely conscious now, not much more than a bundle of want, and goes on killing Thessians and taking what they hold. Its work is no direct threat to most of the Astra so far. In the near term it thins the Thessians; in the long run it grows.
